Package: lpplsF
Title: Log-Periodic Power Law Singularity Model for Financial Bubbles
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Martin Hoshi", "Vognsen", , "martinvognsen@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4460-7763"))
Description: Implementation of the Log-Periodic Power Law Singularity (LPPLS) 
    model for detecting and analysing financial bubbles. Based on the calibration 
    methods described in Filimonov & Sornette (2013) and the Modified Profile 
    Likelihood inference from Filimonov, Demos & Sornette (2017). The package 
    provides functions for fitting LPPLS models, computing likelihood intervals
    for critical time estimates, and visualizing results.
